docs {
  The API endpoint allows the user to upload a zip file using an HTTP PUT request. The request should include the zip file to be uploaded as the request body. The response will have a status code of 201 and a Content-Type of text/xml. The response body will contain data, attributes, relationships, and meta information related to the upload operation.
  
  The request body for the API call should include the zip file to be uploaded. The file should be included as the request body with the appropriate content type and format.
  
  For example:
  
  ```
  {
    "file": [file content]
  }
  
   ```
}
